Z||000000||Hym-The-Man||03-19-2001||12:12 AM||||I live in Lawrence Kansas and I am a huge KU fan.  I am good friends with some of the team members and I think that they have the potential to go all the way.  Roy Williams is one of the best coaches in the NCAA and he deserves a big win.  I know that they have the talent to go all the way, sometimes the players get lazy though.I hope that this is the year.  <P>They just had a huge pep rally for them at the Fieldhouse and even though it is spring break the place was packed. <P>I feel for Matt Dougherty and North Carolina though. Matt is a great guy and NC is a great team.<P>I still remember when Ku went to the final four a few years ago, campus went crazy. Poles ripped out of the sidewalk,people on top of buildings, naked people running around. It was kind of like Mardi Gras.<P>Anyway Go Hawks||||reg||1
